###
POST http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nomeCategoria": "Norsa Refrigerantes",
  "descricaoCategoria": "Aquisição de refrigerantes"
}


### Read
GET http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### Read com Pesquisa
GET http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas/buscar?
    nomeCategoria=Alimentos
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas/4
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nomeCategoria": "Aquisição de Refrigerantes",
  "descricaoCategoria": "Despesas com refrigerantes"
}


### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json